/*
This is the config.h.in file for the CMake build system,
CMake build system does not need the config file as all of the
definitions are given as compile definitions (-D...) during the
build. The file still needs to be generated for the files to
compile as they need to include config.h to be able to be 
built with the Automake system.

Do not delete this generated (yet empty) file.
*/